  data: {
    LLM: "Keep track of the 'Angel' (Trump 20) and 'World' (Trump 21). These are your safety cards to regain the lead. If you have the 'Bagatto' (Trump 1), try to save it for the very last trick, but don't get caught if someone leads a trump you can't beat.\n\nThe 'Matto' Save: Use the 'Matto' to avoid using a high trump on a trick you know you can't win. Since you get to keep the Matto regardless of the winner, it's effectively a 'pass' card that preserves your hand strength.\n\nBargaining Aggression: If you have a mediocre hand but hold two Kings, try to demand a higher 'fold' price in the bargaining phase. If the others have great trumps, they might pay you to just start a new hand rather than risk their points against your declarations.",
    Player: "Keep track of the 'Angel' (Trump 20) and 'World' (Trump 21). These are your safety cards to regain the lead. If you have the 'Bagatto' (Trump 1), try to save it for the very last trick, but don't get caught if someone leads a trump you can't beat.\n\nThe 'Matto' Save: Use the 'Matto' to avoid using a high trump on a trick you know you can't win. Since you get to keep the Matto regardless of the winner, it's effectively a 'pass' card that preserves your hand strength.\n\nBargaining Aggression: If you have a mediocre hand but hold two Kings, try to demand a higher 'fold' price in the bargaining phase. If the others have great trumps, they might pay you to just start a new hand rather than risk their points against your declarations.",
    aggressiveness: 0.5,
    riskTolerance: 0.5,
    bluffFrequency: 0.3,
